== Effects ==
* After clearing a room, adds a 25% chance to spawn a [[friendly]] {{E|Bony}}.
** 25% of spawned Bonies are {{E|Black Bony|text=Black Bonies}}.

== Synergies ==
* {{a|Golden Trinket}} / {{i|Mom's Box}} / '''multiple copies''': Copies and boosts increase the chance to spawn Bonies, first to 33%, 50%, then 100% at 4 copies. However, the chance becomes virtually zero with 6 or more copies due to a programming oversight. <!-- there is no bounds check on the number of copies, so the "1 in 5 minus copies" check becomes "1 in 2^32", unless the function just plain never succeeds -->

== Interactions ==
* [[Cards and Runes|Ace Cards]]: Friendly monsters are still affected by Ace Cards.
* {{i|Blood Puppy}}: Either version of Blood Puppy will target friendly enemies and can drag them along with it when it charges them. Blood Puppy cannot damage friendly enemies; however, friendly enemies can damage Blood Puppy despite not targeting it.
* {{i|Broken Modem}}: Broken Modem also affects friendly enemies and projectiles created by them.
* {{I|Eraser}}: Bonies erased by Eraser will never spawn again, greatly diminishing the value of Polished Bone. If Black Bonies are also erased, Polished Bone becomes useless.
* {{I|Ghost Bombs}} / {{i|Hungry Soul}} / {{I|Purgatory}} / {{i|Vade Retro}}: Explosions from ghosts can kill friendly enemies.

